// A terminator's targets and what each one gets: `b` pushed onto that
// target's predecessor list. Composed out of `pred_succ`'s loop so the
// length is read fresh every pass through -- `ir_bl` cannot appear inside
// `len`'s own argument list.

succ_count(int v) {
  int[] bl = ir_bl(v);
  int n = len(bl);
} return int n;
